app={"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebApplication","name":"Loftia Crop Profit Calculator","url":BASE,"applicationCategory":"GameApplication","operatingSystem":"Any (web browser)","offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"0","priceCurrency":"USD"},"description":"Free fan-made calculator for crop profit and Dew per hour in Loftia."}
faqhtml=''.join(f'<details><summary>{q}</summary><p>{a}</p></details>' for q,a in faq)
home=f'''<h1>Loftia Crop Profit Calculator</h1><p>Find the best crop in <b>Loftia</b>: profit per harvest, Dew per hour and total Dew for your plots and play session. Every value can be edited, so you can plug in new Early Access numbers yourself.</p>
<div class="card"><div class="ctl"><label>Plots (garden bed slots)<input id="plots" type="number" min="1" value="1"></label><label>Session length (min)<input id="mins" type="number" min="1" value="60"></label>
<label><span><input id="rapid" type="checkbox"> Rapid Growth perk</span><span class="muted">crops grow 20% faster</span></label><label><span><input id="fruit" type="checkbox"> Fruitful Harvest perk</span><span class="muted">+20% expected yield</span></label>
<button class="btn alt" id="addc" type="button">+ Add crop</button><button class="btn alt" id="resetc" type="button">Reset</button></div>
<p id="bestout" style="font-weight:600;margin:.8rem 0 .3rem"></p><div class="tbl"><table><thead><tr><th>Crop</th><th>Seed cost</th><th>Sell price</th><th>Grow (min)</th><th>Yield</th><th>Profit / harvest</th><th>Dew / hour / plot</th><th>Session total</th></tr></thead><tbody id="cbody"></tbody></table></div>
<p class="muted">Prices are in Dew. Seed cost, sell price and grow time come from the demo (community-verified, {C['checked']}). Yield per harvest and seasons are <b>TBD</b>; yield defaults to 1. Dew/hour assumes you replant the moment a crop is ready; watering time is not counted. Perk math is our estimate (grow time ÷ 1.2, yield × 1.2).</p></div>
<h2>Best crops in Loftia, ranked (demo)</h2><ol>{''.join(f'<li><a href="crops/{c["slug"]}/">{c["name"]}</a>: {(c["sell"]-c["seed"])*60/c["grow"]:.0f} Dew/hour per plot ({c["sell"]-c["seed"]} Dew profit every {c["grow"]} min)</li>' for c in rank)}</ol>
<p>Tomato is the clear winner for pure Dew. The others tie, so pick by what you need: Carrot and Lettuce feed many recipes, Cotton goes into tailoring, Potato is the slowest but needs watering less often than Lettuce. See all <a href="crops/">Loftia crops</a>, plan perks with the <a href="skill-planner/">Loftia skill planner</a>, or read the <a href="guides/money/">beginner money guide</a>.</p>
<h2>About Loftia</h2><p>Loftia is a cozy multiplayer game from Qloud Games set on floating sky islands, where you farm, salvage, craft, cook, decorate and go on adventures with friends. The Steam Next Fest demo runs Oct 19-26, 2026, and Early Access opens on <a href="guides/release-date/">November 3, 2026</a> on Steam and Epic (PC/Mac).</p>
<h2>FAQ</h2>{faqhtml}'''
urls.append(page('','Loftia Crop Profit Calculator: Best Crops & Dew per Hour','Free Loftia crop calculator: compare profit per harvest, Dew per hour and session totals for Tomato, Potato, Carrot, Lettuce and Cotton. Editable, with skill perks.',home,[app,faqld],f'<script>window.CROPS={cj};window.ROOT="REL";</script><script src="REL/assets/calc.js".replace></script>'.replace('<script src="REL/assets/calc.js".replace></script>','<script src="RELassets/calc.js"></script>')))
