rb='<p class="muted"><a href="../../">Home</a> › <a href="../">Guides</a></p><h1>Loftia Release Date, Demo & Platforms</h1><p>Here is what is officially confirmed about when and where you can play Loftia.</p><div class="card"><table><tr><th>Demo</th><td>Oct 19 - Oct 26, 2026 (Steam Next Fest)</td></tr><tr><th>Early Access</th><td>Nov 3, 2026, 1 PM ET</td></tr><tr><th>Stores</th><td>Steam (app 2320980), Epic Games Store</td></tr><tr><th>Platforms</th><td>Windows, Mac; Switch in 2027</td></tr><tr><th>Price</th><td>$29.99 US base price; 17% launch discount to $24.89 for a limited time; regional pricing; optional cosmetic shop</td></tr><tr><th>Developer</th><td>Qloud Games</td></tr></table></div><h2>Demo notes</h2><ul><li>Your progress and character name carry into Early Access.</li><li>If you claim a name in the demo but do not log in between Nov 3, 2026 and Feb 3, 2027, the name is released.</li><li>Demo features: farming, decorating, sharing, salvaging, adventures and social play, plus the main questline in Loftia City.</li><li>Rewards include a Demo Banner, and a Pebble Chair / Pebble Couch for inviting 1 / 2 friends.</li><li>Early Access adds districts such as the Hanging Gardens (fishing, community farms) and Gridfall (salvaging).</li></ul><h2>FAQ</h2>'+''.join(f'<details><summary>{q}</summary><p>{a}</p></details>' for q,a in rq)+'<p class="muted">Sources: <a href="https://loftia.gg/demo/" rel="nofollow">loftia.gg/demo</a>, <a href="https://loftia.gg/" rel="nofollow">loftia.gg FAQ</a>, <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/2320980/" rel="nofollow">Steam store page</a>.</p>'
urls.append(page('guides/release-date/','Loftia Release Date: Early Access Nov 3, Price $29.99, Demo & Platforms','Loftia release date: Early Access Nov 3, 2026 on Steam & Epic (PC/Mac), $29.99 ($24.89 at launch), demo Oct 19-26, Switch in 2027.',rb,[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":q,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":a}} for q,a in rq]}]))
mb='''<p class="muted"><a href="../../">Home</a> › <a href="../">Guides</a></p><h1>How to Make Money in Loftia: Beginner Dew Guide</h1><p>Dew is Loftia's currency. These tips are based on demo numbers; check them again once Early Access is live.</p>
<ol><li><b>Grow Tomatoes once you can.</b> 15 Dew seed, 30 Dew sale, 15 minutes: roughly 60 Dew per hour per plot, double any other demo crop.</li>
<li><b>Fill every plot.</b> Income scales with plots, so the number of garden bed slots matters more than which of the 30 Dew/hour crops you pick.</li>
<li><b>Mind the watering timer.</b> Lettuce and Tomato want water every 5 minutes, Carrot, Potato and Cotton every 10. If you are away a lot, Potato needs the least attention per Dew.</li>
<li><b>Cooking is not always better than selling raw.</b> Community data shows Garden Salad (Tomato + Lettuce + Carrot) at the top of cooking profit, about 20 Dew over its ingredients; many dishes add only 10-17 Dew. Carrot Soup sells for 35 Dew but uses two Carrots worth 30.</li>
<li><b>Open the Daily Goodies Chest.</b> It can give free Lettuce, Carrot and Cotton seeds, which turns their sale into pure profit.</li>
<li><b>Plan Farming perks.</b> Fruitful Harvest (Lv 11) and Rapid Growth (Lv 16) both raise output; see the <a href="../../skill-planner/#farming">skill planner</a>.</li></ol>
<p>Run your own numbers in the <a href="../../">Loftia crop profit calculator</a>.</p><p class="muted">Sources: <a href="https://loftiacodex.com/economy" rel="nofollow">loftiacodex.com/economy</a>, crop and seed item pages on loftiacodex.com (demo data, 2026-10-20).</p>'''
urls.append(page('guides/money/','How to Make Money Fast in Loftia: Best Crops for Dew','Beginner Loftia money guide: why Tomato is the best demo crop for Dew, watering times, cooking vs selling raw, and farming perks that boost income.',mb))
src=json.load(open('data/sources.json'))
ab='<h1>About Loftia Tools</h1><p>Loftia Tools is a small, independent fan project that makes calculators and planners for the cozy MMO Loftia. It is <b>not affiliated with, endorsed by or connected to Qloud Games</b>. We do not use official logos.</p><p>We list a number only when we can trace it to a source below. Unknown values are marked TBD, and you can enter your own. Found a mistake or a new Early Access number? Open an issue on <a href="https://github.com/xitangwang/loftia-tools/issues">GitHub</a>.</p><h2 id="sources">Data sources</h2><ul>'+''.join(f'<li>{html.escape(s["what"])}: <a href="{s["url"]}" rel="nofollow">{s["url"]}</a> (checked {s["checked"]})</li>' for s in src)+'</ul>'
urls.append(page('about/','About Loftia Tools & Data Sources','About this unofficial Loftia fan site, how we verify game data, and the list of sources.',ab))
urls.append(page('privacy/','Privacy Policy - Loftia Tools','Privacy policy for Loftia Tools.','<h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated 2026-10-20.</p><p>This site is static. It has no accounts and no forms. Your skill plan is stored only in your browser (localStorage) and in a share link if you create one. We do not run analytics or ads at the moment. If we add analytics or advertising (for example Google AdSense) later, this page will be updated first; such services may use cookies to measure visits and show ads. The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which may log basic request data (see GitHub\'s privacy statement).</p>'))
